<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    Mirrors the main Sample gallery's menu, so the two do not drift. Every page that
    compiles into this head is reachable from here.

    Omitted, because the csproj excludes them from this head: CameraPage, ChatPage, ChatTemplatePage, DocumentSessionPage.

    The flyout is the native AppKit source-list sidebar (MacOSShell.UseNativeSidebar): each section is one
    titled FlyoutItem, which the sidebar shows as a collapsible group, and every page carries an SF Symbol
    (MacOSShell.SystemImage). The FlyoutItems have no Route of their own, so their routes stay implicit and
    Shell.GoToAsync("//route") still finds a page by its own route.
-->
